{"version": 2, "width": 80, "height": 24, "timestamp": 1785076116, "env": {"SHELL": "/usr/bin/zsh", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0.010469, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[36mriverrun\u001b[0m\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mprivacy on Solana, in plain words\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[2m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mstatus       \u001b[0m  \u001b[2mnot connected\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m· run \u001b[36mriverrun connect\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.01132, "o", "    \u001b[1;32m●\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mpost-quantum \u001b[0m  on, everlasting\r\n    \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m  \u001b[2midentity     \u001b[0m  \u001b[2ma different, unlinkable face in every app\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[2mmeasure yours\u001b[0m  \u001b[36mriverrun preflight <wallet>\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mWhat would you like to do?\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[36m1\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mBecome anonymous  \u001b[0m   \u001b[2mthe step-by-step to disappear on Solana\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36m2\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mAm I exposed?     \u001b[0m   \u001b[2mcheck your anonymity right now\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36m3\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mCreate an identity\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mone secret, a different face in every app\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36m4\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mMeasure a pool    \u001b[0m   \u001b[2mits real anonymity vs what it advertises\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[2mc\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mconnect / disconnect\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mactivate or clear your identity\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mq\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mquit\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[36m›\u001b[0m "]
[2.210374, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1mBecome anonymous on Solana\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mBreak the link between you and what you do. Not hiding the transaction,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mhiding WHO did it. Four steps. riverrun never touches your keys.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[36m1\u001b[0m  \u001b[1mWhere are you now?\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[36m›\u001b[0m the wallet you use today (or Enter to skip) › "]
[4.811799, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[36m2\u001b[0m  \u001b[1mUse a fresh wallet for the sensitive action\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[2mA new wallet with no history that ties it to you.\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[36msolana-keygen new -o fresh.json\u001b[0m   \u001b[2m(riverrun never sees your keys)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[36m3\u001b[0m  \u001b[1mFund it into a crowd\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[2mFund the fresh wallet from an origin many people share, so you blend in.\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[1;32mdo   \u001b[0m  \u001b[2mwithdraw to it from a major exchange: thousands share that origin\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[1;31mavoid\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mfunding it from your current wallet, that re-links you at once\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[36m4\u001b[0m  \u001b[1mAct, then verify you disappeared\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[2mDo your action from the fresh wallet, then check your anonymity:\u001b[0m\r\n     \u001b[36m›\u001b[0m the fresh wallet, to verify (or Enter to skip) › "]
[8.213574, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1;32m✓\u001b[0m  \u001b[2mriverrun keeps watching and warns you if your crowd shrinks.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mWhat would you like to do?\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[36m1\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mBecome anonymous  \u001b[0m   \u001b[2mthe step-by-step to disappear on Solana\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36m2\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mAm I exposed?     \u001b[0m   \u001b[2mcheck your anonymity right now\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36m3\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mCreate an identity\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mone secret, a different face in every app\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36m4\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mMeasure a pool    \u001b[0m   \u001b[2mits real anonymity vs what it advertises\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[2mc\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mconnect / disconnect\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mactivate or clear your identity\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mq\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mquit\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[36m›\u001b[0m "]
[10.214803, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1mLet's create your private identity.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[10.214965, "o", "  \u001b[2mOne secret becomes a different, unlinkable identity in every app you use.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1;32m✓\u001b[0m your secret (write it down, it is your whole identity):\r\n      \u001b[1m9f073503b589a30daf265e82ed7b0754a424e1f4f97afd48a511933112d51b74\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[36m›\u001b[0m which app or place? (e.g. dao-vote, airdrop) › "]
[12.416302, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1;32m✓\u001b[0m your identity for \u001b[36mdao-vote\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.416425, "o", "      \u001b[2mwho you are :\u001b[0m \u001b[1me8a546c5f41e\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mnobody can link this to your other apps\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[2mone action  :\u001b[0m \u001b[1mc0eefa643a16\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mspend once, e.g. one vote or one claim\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[36m›\u001b[0m another one? (or press Enter to finish) › "]
[15.017649, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1;32m✓\u001b[0m your identity for \u001b[36mairdrop\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[2mwho you are :\u001b[0m \u001b[1m538ee0bebc22\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mnobody can link this to your other apps\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[2mone action  :\u001b[0m \u001b[1mfc69bd799564\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mspend once, e.g. one vote or one claim\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1;33m→\u001b[0m your two identities are completely different.\r\n      \u001b[2mthat is the whole point: one secret, and no one can connect them to you.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.017791, "o", "  \u001b[36m›\u001b[0m another one? (or press Enter to finish) › "]
[17.819118, "o", "\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mWhat would you like to do?\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[36m1\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mBecome anonymous  \u001b[0m   \u001b[2mthe step-by-step to disappear on Solana\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36m2\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mAm I exposed?     \u001b[0m   \u001b[2mcheck your anonymity right now\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36m3\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mCreate an identity\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mone secret, a different face in every app\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[36m4\u001b[0m   \u001b[1mMeasure a pool    \u001b[0m   \u001b[2mits real anonymity vs what it advertises\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[2mc\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mconnect / disconnect\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mactivate or clear your identity\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2mq\u001b[0m   \u001b[2mquit\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[36m›\u001b[0m "]
[19.620319, "o", "  stay private.\r\n"]
